@startuml UC-66
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-66.md
title UC-66: Change Role
footer Feature AUSR-04 | Business rules: BR-04, BR-07
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/UsersController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "UserService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Choose a new role (Customer / Staff / Admin)
MVC -> API : PATCH /api/admin/users/{id}/role { role }
API -> SVC : ChangeRoleAsync(currentUserId, id, role)
alt id = current Admin
  SVC --> API : BadRequest
  API --> MVC : 400 Bad Request
  MVC --> U : Show "You cannot change your own role"
else another user
  SVC -> DB : Load user
  SVC -> DB : Set Role\nSaveChangesAsync (BR-07)
  note right of SVC : The new role applies when the user's next\naccess token is issued (BR-04)
  SVC --> API : OK
  API --> MVC : 204 No Content
  MVC --> U : Show new role
end

@enduml
